  "implementation": [
    "ResourceFileDiscovery owns direct files and ordered directory traversal; ResourceCatalog delegates discovery for automatic/configured/extension/CLI roots.",
    "A regular, exact SKILL.md stops child/alias traversal even if its later metadata read/parse fails. Without a declaration, only the scan root admits other .md skills; nested directories admit declarations. Hidden skill entries and node_modules are skipped.",
    "Prompt directories admit all regular case-sensitive .md children, including hidden names, without recursion. File/directory links are followed; broken/nonregular files are excluded.",
    "File/directory caps removed. Branch-local ancestor identities stop linked cycles without truncating unrelated paths; the cycle guard has native-only evidence."
  ],
